480 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Ancillary revenue has become increasingly important across the airline industry, and NorthByte's leadership views it as a key area for growth.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
481 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Not all revenue stays with NorthByte. Under its customer promise, NorthByte refunds a passenger's full fare when their flight is cancelled or delayed by more than three hours. Refunds are recorded as separate transactions against the original booking. Some parts of NorthByte's network are far more exposed to weather disruptions than others, especially during the winter.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
482 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Finally, many of NorthByte's customers belong to NorthByte Rewards, its free membership program. Members are placed into Blue, Silver, Gold, or Platinum tiers based on how often they fly, with higher tiers receiving perks such as priority boarding, lounge access, and earning points per flight. Travelers who have not joined the program are recorded as Non-Members.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [21]
>>
