/S /H5
/P 265 0 R
/T (NorthByte Airlines finds itself at a turning point. After more than a decade of steady growth, the Vancouver-based carrier just recorded its highest revenue ever, and yet it is now losing tens of millions of dollars a year. Bookings are up, customers are loyal, and new destinations keep being added to the map. )
/E (NorthByte Airlines finds itself at a turning point. After more than a decade of steady growth, the Vancouver-based carrier just recorded its highest revenue ever, and yet it is now losing tens of millions of dollars a year. Bookings are up, customers are loyal, and new destinations keep being added to the map. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
