/E (To operate at an airport, NorthByte leases departure gates on an annual basis. Each lease has a fixed yearly cost that NorthByte pays regardless of how many flights use the gate, and a single gate can be shared by several routes departing from that airport. NorthByte only pays for gates at the airport a flight departs from; arriving flights add no gate cost. Lease prices vary widely: gates at major hubs cost far more than gates at smaller regional airports, and prices are renegotiated every year.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [12]
