/P 1676 0 R
/E (transactions.csv contains every customer transaction recorded between September 2024 and August 2026, including ticket sales, ancillary purchases, change fees, and refunds. Each row is one transaction linked to a booking, a route, the customer's NorthByte Rewards tier, the booking channel, and the payment method. Each row is one transaction, identified by a transaction ID. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [13]
>>
