3906 0 obj
<<
/Title (NorthByte Airlines finds itself at a turning point. After more than a decade of steady growth, the Vancouver-based carrier just recorded its highest revenue ever, and yet it is now losing tens of millions of dollars a year. Bookings are up, customers are loyal, and new destinations keep being added to the map.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3716 0 R
/Prev 3785 0 R
/Next 3911 0 R
>>
endobj
3907 0 obj
<<
/Title (NorthByte Airlines is a fully domestic carrier serving 20 airports across Canada, from Victoria to St. John's and as far north as Whitehorse and Yellowknife. Most flights connect through four major airports \(Vancouver, Calgary, Toronto, and Montreal\), while regional routes link smaller cities into the network.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3716 0 R
/Prev 3911 0 R
/First 3912 0 R
